f a second hand-rolled one.\n\nEvery job created this way is owned by a new fixed system account,\n'Jobfynder Sourcing' (migration 20260829010000), not an ad hoc or\nunclaimed-contact row -- unclaimed contacts are scoped to a single\ncreating user's private book and never appear in directory search\n(invariant 20, skills/jobfynder-invariants.md), which is the wrong\nvisibility model for who owns a job-board posting. The real external\nrecruiter is captured via JobExternalSource/JobRecruiterInfo exactly as\nthe URL-import flow already does it. Adds JobSourceType.EMAIL alongside\nthe existing LINKEDIN/INDEED/CAREER_PAGE/OTHER values.\n\nEvery posting still lands as JobStatus.DRAFT -- this endpoint proposes,\nnothing here publishes. Prerequisite for wiring Hermes's email-parsing\npipeline (claim-and-verify confirmed listings) to actually create job\nboard postings; the Hermes-side push itself is separate follow-up work.\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit clean across the whole project; eslint clean on\nevery changed line (pre-existing CRLF/prettier noise in this checkout\nconfirmed via git stash to predate this change, left untouched).","timestamp":"2026-11-06T15:09:10-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/ca6eddc127dc98d3fb67d95419b333baaba18bd1","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-28T20:53:39-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-06T15:09:10-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20260829010000_add_email_job_source_and_hermes_system_user/migration.sql"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma","src/hermes/hermes.controller.ts","src/hermes/hermes.module.ts","src/hermes/hermes.service.ts","src/jobs/dto/create-parsed-job.dto.ts"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"ca6eddc127dc98d3fb67d95419b333baaba18bd1","tree_id":"e6504c77f4c584b62777c6e4549c64c56a248d99","distinct":true,"message":"feat(hermes): accept full parsed job payload on POST /hermes/job/create\n\nUpgrades the Hermes-facing job-creation endpoint from a bare title/\nclient/location stub (zero real callers, verified) to the same\nCreateParsedJobDto the human-triggered LinkedIn/Indeed URL-import flow\nalready uses (POST /jobs/from-parsed) -- skills, employment types, work\nauthorizations, benefits, rate range, description, and the external-\nsource/recruiter-contact fields all now resolve through the one\nexisting, validated JobsService.createJobFromParsed code path instead\nof a second hand-rolled one.\n\nEvery job created this way is owned by a new fixed system account,\n'Jobfynder Sourcing' (migration 20260829010000), not an ad hoc or\nunclaimed-contact row -- unclaimed contacts are scoped to a single\ncreating user's private book and never appear in directory search\n(invariant 20, skills/jobfynder-invariants.md), which is the wrong\nvisibility model for who owns a job-board posting. The real external\nrecruiter is captured via JobExternalSource/JobRecruiterInfo exactly as\nthe URL-import flow already does it. Adds JobSourceType.EMAIL alongside\nthe existing LINKEDIN/INDEED/CAREER_PAGE/OTHER values.\n\nEvery posting still lands as JobStatus.DRAFT -- this endpoint proposes,\nnothing here publishes. Prerequisite for wiring Hermes's email-parsing\npipeline (claim-and-verify confirmed listings) to actually create job\nboard postings; the Hermes-side push itself is separate follow-up work.\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit clean across the whole project; eslint clean on\nevery changed line (pre-existing CRLF/prettier noise in this checkout\nconfirmed via git stash to predate this change, left untouched).","timestamp":"2026-11-06T15:09:10-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/ca6eddc127dc98d3fb67d95419b333baaba18bd1","author":{"name":"Pavan","email":"pavan@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-08-28T20:53:39-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"16711